:0:"";}s:17:"Number of Servers";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"226";i:2;s:0:"";}s:25:"Currently Running Seasons";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"227";i:2;s:0:"";}s:9:"Startdate";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"228";i:2;s:0:"";}s:7:"Enddate";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"229";i:2;s:0:"";}s:4:"Link";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"230";i:2;s:0:"";}s:12:"View Matches";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"231";i:2;s:0:"";}s:22:"No Matches played yet.";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"232";i:2;s:0:"";}s:6:"Team A";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"233";i:2;s:0:"";}s:6:"Team B";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"234";i:2;s:0:"";}s:32:"No Teams assigned to this Season";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"235";i:2;s:0:"";}s:11:"Shorthandle";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"236";i:2;s:0:"";}s:12:"Last Seasons";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"237";i:2;s:0:"";}s:4:"Help";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"238";i:2;s:0:"";}s:5:"Error";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"239";i:2;s:0:"";}s:15:"Page not found!";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"240";i:2;s:0:"";}s:56:"You do not have the required rights to access this site!";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"241";i:2;s:0:"";}s:131:"The new version of eBot allows you to have access to more statistics about your matches, but it also makes match management easier.";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"242";i:2;s:0:"";}s:135:"If you encounter any problem with eBot, please read the help section. In this section, you will find both ingame help and website help.";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"243";i:2;s:0:"";}s:5:"Go to";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"244";i:2;s:0:"";}s:21:"for more information!";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"245";i:2;s:0:"";}s:214:"eBot includes a whole series of commands which can be used via the chat, at various moments of the match. With these commands you can ask for your personal stats, the score match, you can restart the match, etc ...";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"246";i:2;s:0:"";}s:29:"Commands usable at any moment";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"247";i:2;s:0:"";}s:31:"displays the available commands";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"248";i:2;s:0:"";}s:77:"sends the statistics of the match (number of kills, K/D ratio, HD ratio, ...)";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"249";i:2;s:0:"";}s:93:"sends the detailed statistics, such as the number of First Kill, 1vX, kill per round, etc ...";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"250";i:2;s:0:"";}s:25:"displays the match status";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"251";i:2;s:0:"";}s:22:"sends the match scores";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"252";i:2;s:0:"";}s:29:"Commands usable during warmup";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"253";i:2;s:0:"";}s:89:"telling the bot that the team is ready. When the 2 teams are ready, the match is launched";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"254";i:2;s:0:"";}s:51:"telling the bot that the team is not ready anymore.";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"255";i:2;s:0:"";}s:34:"Commands usable during knife round";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"256";i:2;s:0:"";}s:133:"tells that your team wants the knife round to be restarted. The restart of the knife round is only possible if the other team agrees.";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"257";i:2;s:0:"";}s:45:"Commands usable at the end of the knife round";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"258";i:2;s:0:"";}s:191:"At the end of the knife round, the winning team <b>WILL HAVE TO</b> tell the eBot what they decide to do (stay or switch). The eBot will automatically switch the players and reverse the team.";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"259";i:2;s:0:"";}s:14:"no team switch";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"260";i:2;s:0:"";}s:18:"switches the teams";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"261";i:2;s:0:"";}s:32:"Commands usable during the match";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"262";i:2;s:0:"";}s:252:"tells the other team that your team wants to stop the match. The match stop is only possible if the other team agrees. The other team will also have to write !stop to stop the match. The match stop makes the match return to the previous state (warmup).";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"263";i:2;s:0:"";}s:71:"tells the other team your team wants to continue the match (if stopped)";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"264";i:2;s:0:"";}s:38:"tells the other team you want to pause";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"265";i:2;s:0:"";}s:40:"tells the other team you want to unpause";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"266";i:2;s:0:"";}s:588:"<p>You can sort the table to have custom statistics.</p>
			<p>The columns <b>1K</b>, <b>2K</b>, ... represent the number of kills per round. i.e : if there is a 2 in the 3K column, in means I played 2 rounds during which I made 3 kills.</p>
			<p>The column <b>FK</b> means <b>First Kill</b>, useful to see who made a first kill</p>
			<p>The clutch points tell if a player made various clutches, such as winning a 1vs1. They are calculated this way : number of won 1 v X multiplied by X. If I made three 1vs1 and a 1vs2, I will therefore have 5 points. (1vs1 x 3 = 3, 1vs2 x 1 = 2)</p>
";a:3:{i:0;s:0:"";i:1;s:3:"267";i:2;s:0:"";}}